  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:120%;background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">* 시계접시 (時計접시, watch glass) :이 실험 기구가 watch glass라고 불린 이유가 회중시계(pocket watch)와 비슷해서 그렇다고 한다. 따라서 외국에서는 큰 시계접시를 clock glass라고도 한다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">여태껏 이게 '볼 시'라고 알고 있었는데, '때 시'네요.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">'군밤'할 때의 억양으로 읽었는데, 이젠 그냥 일반 '시계' 억양으로 읽을 겁니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\">저만 몰랐나요? ㅎ&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Tahoma, Helvetica, Arial, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 120%; text-align: center; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24340036544D5D930A\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"101\" width=\"101\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"noname01.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_24340036544D5D930A5313\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:120%;background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:120%